graph TD
  subgraph Compose
    A[auth_api] -->|depends_on| B[(sqlserver)]
    A -->|depends_on| C[(postgres)]
  end

  subgraph Aspire (optional)
    H[AppHost]
    H --> A
    H --> B
    H --> C
  end

  A -->|:8080| User[Client]
  B -->|:1433| DBA1[SSMS]
  C -->|:5432| DBA2[psql]
